# M5 edge-degradation condition (scripts/netem.sh). PROPOSED 2026-10-10 — pending human approval.
# Applied only to B->A control-plane traffic (:6443, :30090); Locust load (:30080) is untouched.
# Rationale: baseline hotspot RTT median ~20–85 ms, p99 ~180–210 ms; +150 ± 50 ms and 2 % loss emulate a
# congested wireless edge uplink while staying inside the 3.0 s collection deadline on most ticks.
NETEM_DELAY=150ms
NETEM_JITTER=50ms
NETEM_LOSS=2%
